28045      title 'Introductory Main-Effects ANOVA Example';
28046      data a;
28047      input y x1 $ x2 $;
28048      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 12 observations and 3 variables.

28061      ;
28062      * Fit a main-effects ANOVA model with 1, 0, -1 coding;
28063      proc transreg ss2;
28064      model identity(y) = class(x1 x2 / effects);
28065      output coefficients replace;
28066      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DATA39 has 14 observations and 9 variables.
